- P1–P5: PASS
- P6: FAIL — F-D has nonscalar `V_θ` and nonzero curvature, but zero period.
- F-A kill-shot did not fire; L1 survives the probe.
- All six gates are red-capable; both prescribed red modes exited `1`.
- Default exits `1`, bindingly reflecting the P6 failure.

